{"id":"66c9470f107a6bad","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-zfc.md","title":"ZFC Set Theory","display":"df-zfc — ZFC Set Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-zfc","aliases":["92-df-zfc"],"display":"df-zfc — ZFC Set Theory","depends_on":["[[92-df-first-order-language]]","[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]"],"source":"原书之外：通常 ZF+Choice；Marks, Set Theory, §2","source_status":"外部背景的显式成员语言呈现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-zfc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-zfc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc — ZFC Set Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f1751959740e455f\" href=\"?note=f1751959740e455f\" title=\"92-df-first-order-derivation\">92-df-first-order-derivation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外：通常 ZF+Choice；Marks, Set Theory, §2"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景的显式成员语言呈现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\mapsto2\\})\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\mapsto2\\})\\)</span>，语法与语义见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span> 是对象语言关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot\\in\">\\(\\dot\\in\\)</span> 的显示记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq,\\exists!,\\forall x\\in a,\\exists x\\in a\">\\(\\subseteq,\\exists!,\\forall x\\in a,\\exists x\\in a\\)</span> 是有限公式缩写，须按下式展开。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}_{92},\\mathrm{AC}_{92},\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}_{92},\\mathrm{AC}_{92},\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\)</span> 是闭句公理集及选择公理的定义目标；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)\\)</span> 采用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f1751959740e455f\" href=\"?note=f1751959740e455f\" title=\"92-df-first-order-derivation\">92-df-first-order-derivation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in\\)</span> 是成员语言的全称闭包，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a>；按递增变量下标绑定自由参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<p>先固定成员语言的有限公式缩写；不同展开处的辅助变量均无捕获地改名：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}(a,b)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in a\\to x\\in b),&amp;\n\\operatorname{Empty}(a)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x\\neg(x\\in a),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PairSet}(a,b,c)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in c\\leftrightarrow(x=a\\lor x=b)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SuccSet}(a,b)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\lor x=a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{UnionSet}(a,b)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\land x\\in y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PowerSet}(a,b)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sub}(x,a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Induct}(a)&amp;\\equiv(\\exists e(\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\land e\\in a))\\land\n\\forall x(x\\in a\\to\\exists y(\\operatorname{SuccSet}(x,y)\\land y\\in a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Omega}(w)&amp;\\equiv\\operatorname{Induct}(w)\\land\\forall a(\\operatorname{Induct}(a)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}(w,a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OP}(x,y,z)&amp;\\equiv\\exists a\\exists b(\\operatorname{PairSet}(x,x,a)\\land\\operatorname{PairSet}(x,y,b)\\land\\operatorname{PairSet}(a,b,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)&amp;\\equiv\\exists z(z\\in f\\land\\operatorname{OP}(x,y,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,B)&amp;\\equiv\n\\forall z(z\\in f\\to\\exists x\\in A\\exists y\\in B\\operatorname{OP}(x,y,z))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in A\\exists y\\in B\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in A\\forall y\\in B\\forall z\\in B\n((\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,z))\\to y=z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(A,B)&amp;\\equiv\\exists f[\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,B)\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\forall z\\in A\\forall y\\in B\n((\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Edge}(f,z,y))\\to x=z)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)&amp;\\equiv\\exists f[\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,B)\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\forall z\\in A\\forall y\\in B\n((\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Edge}(f,z,y))\\to x=z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall y\\in B\\exists x\\in A\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}(a,b)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in a\\to x\\in b),&amp;\n\\operatorname{Empty}(a)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x\\neg(x\\in a),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PairSet}(a,b,c)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in c\\leftrightarrow(x=a\\lor x=b)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SuccSet}(a,b)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\lor x=a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{UnionSet}(a,b)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\land x\\in y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PowerSet}(a,b)&amp;\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sub}(x,a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Induct}(a)&amp;\\equiv(\\exists e(\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\land e\\in a))\\land\n\\forall x(x\\in a\\to\\exists y(\\operatorname{SuccSet}(x,y)\\land y\\in a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Omega}(w)&amp;\\equiv\\operatorname{Induct}(w)\\land\\forall a(\\operatorname{Induct}(a)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}(w,a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OP}(x,y,z)&amp;\\equiv\\exists a\\exists b(\\operatorname{PairSet}(x,x,a)\\land\\operatorname{PairSet}(x,y,b)\\land\\operatorname{PairSet}(a,b,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)&amp;\\equiv\\exists z(z\\in f\\land\\operatorname{OP}(x,y,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,B)&amp;\\equiv\n\\forall z(z\\in f\\to\\exists x\\in A\\exists y\\in B\\operatorname{OP}(x,y,z))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in A\\exists y\\in B\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in A\\forall y\\in B\\forall z\\in B\n((\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,z))\\to y=z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(A,B)&amp;\\equiv\\exists f[\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,B)\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\forall z\\in A\\forall y\\in B\n((\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Edge}(f,z,y))\\to x=z)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)&amp;\\equiv\\exists f[\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,B)\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\forall z\\in A\\forall y\\in B\n((\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Edge}(f,z,y))\\to x=z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall y\\in B\\exists x\\in A\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in a\\,A\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)\">\\(\\forall x\\in a\\,A\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\in a\\,A\\equiv\\exists x(x\\in a\\land A)\">\\(\\exists x\\in a\\,A\\equiv\\exists x(x\\in a\\land A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists!x A\">\\(\\exists!x A\\)</span> 展开为存在与以新变量表达的唯一性。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}_{92}\\)</span> 包含以下闭句，以及分离与替换模式的全部全称闭包：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall a\\forall b[\\forall x(x\\in a\\leftrightarrow x\\in b)\\to a=b],\\qquad\\exists a\\operatorname{Empty}(a),\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\exists c\\operatorname{PairSet}(a,b,c),\\qquad\n\\forall a\\exists b\\operatorname{UnionSet}(a,b),\\\\\n\\forall a\\exists b\\operatorname{PowerSet}(a,b),\\qquad\\exists a\\operatorname{Induct}(a),\\\\\n\\forall a[\\neg\\operatorname{Empty}(a)\\to\\exists b\\in a\\forall x\\in a\\neg(x\\in b)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall a\\forall b[\\forall x(x\\in a\\leftrightarrow x\\in b)\\to a=b],\\qquad\\exists a\\operatorname{Empty}(a),\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\exists c\\operatorname{PairSet}(a,b,c),\\qquad\n\\forall a\\exists b\\operatorname{UnionSet}(a,b),\\\\\n\\forall a\\exists b\\operatorname{PowerSet}(a,b),\\qquad\\exists a\\operatorname{Induct}(a),\\\\\n\\forall a[\\neg\\operatorname{Empty}(a)\\to\\exists b\\in a\\forall x\\in a\\neg(x\\in b)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x,\\vec p)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\">\\(\\varphi(x,\\vec p)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\)</span>，选不出现的新变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span>，加入</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in\\left(\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x\n\\left[x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\land\\varphi(x,\\vec p))\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in\\left(\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x\n\\left[x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\land\\varphi(x,\\vec p))\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\">\\(\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\)</span>，选不出现的新变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span>，加入</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in\\left(\\forall a\\left[\n(\\forall x\\in a\\exists!y\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p))\\to\n\\exists b\\forall y(y\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in a\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p))\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in\\left(\\forall a\\left[\n(\\forall x\\in a\\exists!y\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p))\\to\n\\exists b\\forall y(y\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in a\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p))\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AC}_{92}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall A\\left[(\\forall a\\in A\\neg\\operatorname{Empty}(a))\\to\n\\exists U\\exists f(\\operatorname{UnionSet}(A,U)\\land\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,U)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\forall b\\in U(\\operatorname{Edge}(f,a,b)\\to b\\in a))\\right],\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}_{92}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}_{92}\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AC}_{92}&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall A\\left[(\\forall a\\in A\\neg\\operatorname{Empty}(a))\\to\n\\exists U\\exists f(\\operatorname{UnionSet}(A,U)\\land\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,U)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\forall b\\in U(\\operatorname{Edge}(f,a,b)\\to b\\in a))\\right],\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}_{92}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}_{92}\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这些是纯成员语言的有限公式及有效模式；花括号中的集合对象只出现在元理论的公理集定义，不是对象语言的集合项。所有辅助缩写按依赖顺序有限展开，固定新变量策略使其确定。\n该本地公理集与 58 号书的通常 ZFC 内容对应，但这里没有把其另一语言编码无说明地重命名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\vdash_\\in\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\vdash_\\in\\varphi\\)</span> 是配上一般经典演算后的可导性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\)</span> 本身只是公理集合。\n将第二不完备性用于 ZFC 还需固定其有限证明的有效编码、内部算术解释及满足 HBL 的标准可证性公式。外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}\\)</span> 不是一个可送入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_\\in\">\\(\\vdash_\\in\\)</span> 的句子，本定义不伪造这样的内部式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本节点是原书之外的集合论背景。公理列表可对照 <a href=\"https://math.berkeley.edu/~marks/notes/set_theory_notes_4.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Andrew Marks, Set Theory, §2</a>；上述公式是本地展开，不是 Smullyan PDF 的原文。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"f1751959740e455f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_\\in=(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\mapsto2\\})$，语法与语义见[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"f1751959740e455f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZF}_{92},\\mathrm{AC}_{92},\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}$ 是闭句公理集及选择公理的定义目标；$T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi$ 与 $\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)$ 采用[[92-df-first-order-derivation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in$ 是成员语言的全称闭包，见[[92-df-first-order-language]]；按递增变量下标绑定自由参数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in=(\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\mapsto2\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq,\\exists!,\\forall x\\in a,\\exists x\\in a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF}_{92},\\mathrm{AC}_{92},\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_\\in\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Sub}(a,b)&\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in a\\to x\\in b),&\n\\operatorname{Empty}(a)&\\equiv\\forall x\\neg(x\\in a),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PairSet}(a,b,c)&\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in c\\leftrightarrow(x=a\\lor x=b)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SuccSet}(a,b)&\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\lor x=a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{UnionSet}(a,b)&\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists y(y\\in a\\land x\\in y)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PowerSet}(a,b)&\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sub}(x,a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Induct}(a)&\\equiv(\\exists e(\\operatorname{Empty}(e)\\land e\\in a))\\land\n\\forall x(x\\in a\\to\\exists y(\\operatorname{SuccSet}(x,y)\\land y\\in a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Omega}(w)&\\equiv\\operatorname{Induct}(w)\\land\\forall a(\\operatorname{Induct}(a)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}(w,a)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{OP}(x,y,z)&\\equiv\\exists a\\exists b(\\operatorname{PairSet}(x,x,a)\\land\\operatorname{PairSet}(x,y,b)\\land\\operatorname{PairSet}(a,b,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)&\\equiv\\exists z(z\\in f\\land\\operatorname{OP}(x,y,z)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,B)&\\equiv\n\\forall z(z\\in f\\to\\exists x\\in A\\exists y\\in B\\operatorname{OP}(x,y,z))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in A\\exists y\\in B\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in A\\forall y\\in B\\forall z\\in B\n((\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,z))\\to y=z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inj}(A,B)&\\equiv\\exists f[\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,B)\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\forall z\\in A\\forall y\\in B\n((\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Edge}(f,z,y))\\to x=z)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{Bij}(A,B)&\\equiv\\exists f[\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,B)\\land\n\\forall x\\in A\\forall z\\in A\\forall y\\in B\n((\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)\\land\\operatorname{Edge}(f,z,y))\\to x=z)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall y\\in B\\exists x\\in A\\operatorname{Edge}(f,x,y)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in a\\,A\\equiv\\forall x(x\\in a\\to A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x\\in a\\,A\\equiv\\exists x(x\\in a\\land A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!x A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZF}_{92}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall a\\forall b[\\forall x(x\\in a\\leftrightarrow x\\in b)\\to a=b],\\qquad\\exists a\\operatorname{Empty}(a),\\\\\n\\forall a\\forall b\\exists c\\operatorname{PairSet}(a,b,c),\\qquad\n\\forall a\\exists b\\operatorname{UnionSet}(a,b),\\\\\n\\forall a\\exists b\\operatorname{PowerSet}(a,b),\\qquad\\exists a\\operatorname{Induct}(a),\\\\\n\\forall a[\\neg\\operatorname{Empty}(a)\\to\\exists b\\in a\\forall x\\in a\\neg(x\\in b)].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi(x,\\vec p)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in\\left(\\forall a\\exists b\\forall x\n\\left[x\\in b\\leftrightarrow(x\\in a\\land\\varphi(x,\\vec p))\\right]\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_\\in\\left(\\forall a\\left[\n(\\forall x\\in a\\exists!y\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p))\\to\n\\exists b\\forall y(y\\in b\\leftrightarrow\\exists x\\in a\\varphi(x,y,\\vec p))\\right]\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AC}_{92}&\\coloneqq\\forall A\\left[(\\forall a\\in A\\neg\\operatorname{Empty}(a))\\to\n\\exists U\\exists f(\\operatorname{UnionSet}(A,U)\\land\\operatorname{Func}(f,A,U)\n\\land\\forall a\\in A\\forall b\\in U(\\operatorname{Edge}(f,a,b)\\to b\\in a))\\right],\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ZF}_{92}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{AC}_{92}\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}\\vdash_\\in\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}_{92}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{meta},\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_\\in","display":false}],"bytes":5608,"backlinks":[{"id":"83eb2b67a65ec154","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bc49b3195ceaea0d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"成员语言的 $\\operatorname{Omega},\\operatorname{PowerSet},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Inj},\\operatorname{Bij}$ 是[[92-df-zfc]]中的有限公式缩写。"},{"id":"1c09889422d33e53","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b